<title>Ethiopia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ethiopia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ethiopia-2026-10-31T22:38:39.504Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 22:38:39 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Ethiopian prime minister has placed senior ministers in military training at a centre in Hurso while army drones have struck displaced persons camps in Amhara, killing civilians including children, and a separate drone strike in Tigray killed civilians collecting grain. Sudan has accused Ethiopia of supplying the RSF with arms and of using Assosa Airport as a launch base for RSF drones. Two attacks four days apart in Oromia killed 60 Orthodox Christians. The conflict continues amid the Fano insurgency in Amhara, which began in 2023 over the government's security reforms. 2,824 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFA1LVJRU1FVNjJwb1g1TFM3bzYwOFlEVkYyWFF5UGx4aDlXQ1pZSHI2VWpucmFuT2tTeWg3MUdvajR1aGxUN1FrSUlJMC1sUlVUR1RoUXFFdGdEaWNDX1E?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxOM19qa3dlSGstRTVESk5KNDNqV1RyblNKQi1tYl9WVjdRNVAtUkVaaWx5NWhxOWpya0dveDljNXEtWlZnRTFFR3ZCSkExTkFrem9ibWcxZ3RyS3g5eWFhbFZlZG85djZQTlluZ0trdnBJVkRxenJodmVUYzE2QTd1aFdXTGh3V3VtYUZXQ0ppNGoxdUVTUW1aTUR1WEJVY1R1Y0lXRnotUFBrVDFlN05DQmhPVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;People Daily&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE5IMVY0VmVPVm1PUlRSbkRsdkhYNDRHQ1JaZXF1cTd0Y3ZfUVdGMmwtZzFSMDluMFJIZzFuZ2Z5MlkxdkdDUkRKc1dwVzh4V1RK?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiS0FVX3lxTE85RHdQc1M2SkZuM1h5dWJQZ0gtTnVjTTJTODlEaFplb05sR000UGlVZnRKWHdRZkxrSzV5NVNfcEdFNlpNd0YtdnBKMA?oc=5&quot;&gt;صحيفة سبق الإلكترونية&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxO